| Convergence || Player ||align="left"|
Multiplies the amount of [[Affinity]] converted to [[Focus]] points by some multiplier for either a period of '''45 seconds''', until death, or when the daily Focus cap has been reached, whichever is shortest.
*Picking up [[Focus#Convergence|Convergence Orbs]] (8x conversion)
*After entering a new zone in [[Sanctuary Onslaught]] (8-16x, scaling with zones completed)
|-
| Corruption || All ||align="left"|
Obtainable during [[Void Fissure]]s, the effect varies for enemies and Tennos.<br />
'''Enemies''': The target will be stunned temporarily, granting invulnerability during that time frame.
'''Tenno''': After collecting '''10''' Reactants, a buff will be randomly given to either the Warframe or a weapon. The buffed equipment will have a corrupted texture effect and emit lighting bolts for the duration of the buff. The buff duration is based on the tier of the Void Fissure, following the formula: {{MathText|Buff Duration {{eql}} 30s {{mul}} Mission Tier}}.
*[[Warframe]]: Two times multiplier to [[Ability Range]] and [[Ability Strength|Strength]].
**This affects the total value.
**For example, with a maxed {{M|Intensify}} Ability Strength becomes {{Math|(1 + 0.3) {{mul}} 2|mt=y|percent=y}} while the buff is active.
*[[Primary Weapon|Primary]] and [[Secondary Weapon]]s: No [[Ammo]] will be consumed.
*[[Melee 2.0|Melee]] Weapons: [[Channeling]] cost is reduced to '''1''' point of [[Energy]] per enemy hit.
